<title>POLAND: INVESTORS BID FOR PLN 127 MLN POLISH 10-YR BONDS.</title>
<headline>INVESTORS BID FOR PLN 127 MLN POLISH 10-YR BONDS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investors bid for 127 million zlotys of ten-year floating bonds against the Treasury's 600 million zloty offer, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Results of the auction should be available later today.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
